      "id": "start",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Data Sufficiency changes the goal.\n\nYou are not asked to use every statement. You are asked: is the answer uniquely determined?\n\nName the rate information you need, then test statements one at a time.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
